    "turn_text": "Well, you know, I mean, people say that, but it is important, even though you're no, you're not going to get answers from the FBI. a director, even if you feel like you're not going to that, Congress has the responsibility of oversight for the executive branch. And you can't not call hearings and call people to this caliber or this level in administration before you because you know they're just going to stall all. I think it's important for Congress to go through its functions and let people see that there are real questions. I think legitimate questions that you're not getting interest for. We have an issue going with Secretary Becerra of Health and Human Services. We've had him before our committee, and he's really good at deflecting answers, but you still have to do your oversight and try to get as much information as you can. And I will tell you, when these hearings happen, there's a lot of work that happens prior to the hearing, during the hearing, after the hearing. And so even though you may not get, as you said, those aha moments on camera in the middle of a hearing, there's still a lot of work going. Look at what Jamie Comer's committee's done. I mean, nobody would have known Unless they didn't get the information from the FBI, they had information from the banks that the Hunter Biden family and the Biden family has dealt with. So we know that money's gone from China to an account of a friend of President Biden into at least a grandchild account, I think five or six, I think it's up to nine now, family members, hard to keep track of. And nobody can show what they did for that money. Nobody can show the well Hunter Biden was an expert in trade policy. So he went and negotiated something or then they paid him for that. or even lobbied which you're supposed to file if you're far and obvious there there's no work that can be identified and and if you brought Christopher Ray before james committee would probably give the same kind of answers but the fact that you you're putting the investigation together does have value and it does matter and and what jamey comers don his show that it does matter",
